'''Helmets''' is an [[item class]] of armour pieces that can contain up to 4 [[socket]]s. ([[Item level]] may affects the max socket, which can be bypassed by [[crafting bench]] recipe that change the number of sockets).

__TOC__

==Types of helmets==
There are 6 main sub-types of helmets:

* There are 3 single-attribute based sub-types, which require the player to have a threshold amount (indicated in the item's tooltip) of a single type of [[Attribute]]; once equipped, they provide the wearer with the Defence stat of the type associated with the required attribute.

* There are 3 '''Hybrid''' sub-types which require both of the two listed [[Attributes]] to reach a threshold value, in return providing both of the associated [[Defence]] stat types.   Providing multiple defensive stat types from a single item comes at a cost: both defense types provided have a lesser value than their non-hybrid counterparts. This is in addition to the player having to manage more than one attribute in order to be able and/or continue to use the item. 

[[Version 3.15.0]] introduced a 7th sub-type of helmet that utilizes a new Defence known as [[Ward]]. These new base types require an equal amount of each Attribute to equip.

